le-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">月之暗面发布 Kimi Hosted Agents 托管智能体服务</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Perplexity发布全新Teammates功能，以AI代理管理持续性专案</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta 个人 AI 助手 Muse 上线实时语音对话与虚拟形象功能</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash模型：单次生成时长增至15秒，成本降低30%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4699646d66c40c3e0399ff091b60a196.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式发布AI视频生成模型Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash，在生成时长、场景一致性及API定价方面实现全面升级。该模型将单次视频生成时长由10秒提升至15秒，有效减少了长视频创作对拼接的依赖。在成本控制上，720p视频生成费用从每秒0.10美元降至0.07美元，降幅达30%，单段15秒720p视频API成本降至1.05美元。技术层面，新模型强化了多视角下的人物、徽标及文字保持力，并支持多回合对话式编辑，允许用户局部调整光线、背景或拍摄角度，无需全局重绘。此外，模型改进了自然语音处理、唇形同步及多说话人交互能力，支持最高4K输出。目前，Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash已通过Google AI Studio、Google Cloud、Google Flow及Google Vids面向开发者与创</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">淘宝MNN团队开源MNN-Pocket-0.3B模型，iPhone 18 Pro离线解码达350 token/s</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dc8fb6ba207566fadc38f737e394cd79.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">淘宝MNN团队正式开源轻量化大语言模型MNN-Pocket-0.3B，该模型拥有约3亿参数，专为移动端资源受限场景设计。在iPhone 18 Pro真机测试中，其离线解码速度达350 token/s；在iPad Pro M5上，Decode吞吐量达466 token/s，约为Qwen3-0.6B的1.63倍。模型采用INT4量化，部署文件仅173MB，峰值内存增量控制在228MB以内，较同类模型体积缩减约49%。功耗方面，在一加13（骁龙8至尊版）上执行100次任务仅消耗0.3%电量。此外，团队将词表精简至64K，并在IFEval-zh等11项评测中表现优异，全面超越MiniCPM4-0.5B等模型。此次开源涵盖Base、SFT、端侧部署及投机解码等多个版本，旨在赋能移动端AI生态，实现高性能与低能耗的平衡。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">月之暗面发布 Kimi Hosted Agents 托管智能体服务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f522f27f968293bce5fa641ed861e48a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">11月5日，月之暗面（Moonshot AI）正式推出 Kimi Hosted Agents 托管智能体服务。该服务将支撑智能体运行的底层 Harness 框架直接云端化，为企业和开发者提供开箱即用的 7×24 小时全天候托管运行环境。通过此举，月之暗面旨在解决传统 AI 开发中后端运行环境搭建、调试及维护成本高昂的痛点。Kimi Hosted Agents 能够支持长时间跨度的复杂任务执行，并为多智能体（Multi-Agent）协作提供稳定底座。对于行业而言，该服务大幅降低了企业落地高级 AI 应用的技术门槛与运维成本，开发者无需再自行维护复杂的运行框架，即可实现智能体的高效部署与协同，从而加速复杂 AI 业务场景的落地进程。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Perplexity发布全新Teammates功能，以AI代理管理持续性专案</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a7146217b1576a69182e9a05b03a722c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Perplexity正式推出全新「队友」（Teammates）功能，将AI代理的应用场景从单次任务扩展至复杂、持续性的工作管理。该功能基于Perplexity Computer的多模型与精准度基础，支持在行销、销售、客户支援及营运等业务线中，主动监控专案、跨工具协调、处理后续跟进，并能在多次执行间记忆专案目标与共用档案。Teammates具备独立的隔离环境与存取控制，目前已率先在网页版上线，并将于近期登陆iOS平台，仅供Perplexity Max订阅者使用。此次更新标志着AI助理从被动工具向自主规划、协调并执行的企业级营运代理程式转型，旨在推动AI在复杂工作流程中的深度落地，提升跨团队协作效率。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta 个人 AI 助手 Muse 上线实时语音对话与虚拟形象功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d5b256fb8d19e8a800496f952486380f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">11月6日，Meta 宣布个人 AI 助手 Muse 正式上线实时语音对话与虚拟形象功能，首批面向美国用户开放，覆盖移动端、网页及 Mac 应用。该功能由 Muse Realtime Voice 与 Muse Realtime Avatar 两个模型协同驱动，前者负责内容生成与语调控制，后者实时同步表情、口型及动作，实现音画无缝衔接。系统支持流式输出 448×768 分辨率、25fps 的竖屏视频，端到端响应延迟约为 870 毫秒。用户可通过点击应用右上角图标开启对话，支持随时打断，并提供数百种声音风格及多种虚拟形象选择。该功能旨在满足用户在双手忙碌等场景下的交互需求，支持语音任务处理、头脑风暴及面试模拟等应用，并允许将生成的虚拟形象内容一键分享至 Instagram、Facebook 和 WhatsApp 等</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
